*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 1008HT-3N3
* Inductance = 3.3nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-14.2GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 1008HT-3N3 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.042pF Ind=3.3nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=4
+ R2=0.05
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.0000098
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends 1008HT-3N3

